> async-aws builds the request when the client method is called, and sends it when its result is resolved or freed

This is not accurate. It sends the request immediately, but does not wait for its response to return.
The behavior in async-aws is actually the behavior implemented in symfony/http-client. The async-aws client sends the request and wraps the Response in its Result object without waiting for the response to settle until the Result needs to be resolved.

